  "description": "A reader for OASIS Common Alerting Protocol (CAP) 1.2 marine weather warnings: one CAP alert, an Atom feed of them (whole alerts or the NWS entries) and the NWS GeoJSON form from api.weather.gov/alerts. Turns each alert area into polygons (CAP polygons, circles as 64-vertex polygons, and NWS marine zone codes resolved against a bundled, simplified copy of the public-domain NWS marine zone layer), judges which alerts are in force at a time, and draws them with code-defined outlines, severity hatching and event labels. Drawn by CapDatasetProcessor in Datasets.Pipelines. Not for navigation.",
